Error [jet.AmbientIoInPackageBuild]: `read_file` is not allowed during a sandboxed package build
  --> env.jet:3:30
    |
  3 |     services: { db: { ready: read_file("/etc/hostname") } }
    |                              ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Package builds run with ambient I/O and network access disabled
 Fix: Compute this value at compile time or pass it in as a parameter
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3402
